        <fullName>Core_MDF_Ineffective_Date_dt__c</fullName>
        <description>Field to Capture the Date from when bank becomes Ineffective.</description>
        <formula>IF( Core_MDF_Ineffective_Selection_ind__c, TODAY(), NULL)</formula>
        <formulaTreatBlanksAs>BlankAsZero</formulaTreatBlanksAs>
        <inlineHelpText>Once inactive, the bank is no longer available for selection for a reimbursement request. The system will not allow bank to be inactivated if it has active claims. </inlineHelpText>
        <label>Ineffective Date</label>
